---
// Seasonal accessories drawn over the cover portrait, in the photo's own pixel space (headshot.jpg, 460 x 460):
// eyes at about (213, 155) and (270, 158), top of the hair at y 42, neck at y 260-290, head tilted ~3 degrees.
// seasons.js sets data-season / data-hat on the sleeve and seasons.css shows the matching group.
// Refit these coordinates whenever the photo changes.
---
